{"hymn":"S110","parent":"E133","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¡Señor de todos! Oh Jesús","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su exaltación","syl":{"n1":["¡Se","i"],"n2":["ñor","t"],"n3":"de","n4":["to","i"],"n5":["dos!","t"],"n6":"Oh","n7":["Je","i"],"n8":["sús,","t"],"n9":["Lle","i"],"n10":["no","t"],"n11":"de","n13":["glo","i"],"n14":["ria‿es","m"],"n15":["tás;","t"],"n16":["Re","i"],"n17":["nom","m"],"n19":["bra","m"],"n21":["do","t"],"n22":"por","n24":"Tu","n25":["po","i"],"n26":["der,","t"],"n27":["Co","i"],"n28":["ro","m"],"n29":["na‿y","t"],"n31":["ma","i"],"n32":["jes","m"],"n33":["tad.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Dios en la tierra hombre fue,","Humilde Servidor;","Un hombre en Dios en los cielos","De todos es Señor."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Como hombre en la gloria estás,","Tu Dios te entronó;","Todo poder en los cielos","Y en la tierra te dio."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Dios a los cielos te exaltó,","¡Qué nombre se te dio!","A Ti todos se inclinarán,","Te llamarán Señor."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Señor y Cristo te hizo Dios,","Su Espíritu afirmó","El trono de la Majestad","Que compartes con Dios."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Señor de gloria eres Tú,","Te alzamos hoy canción;","De todos eres el Señor,","Digno de adoración."]}]}